# Copy to `.env` and fill in YOUR OWN values. `.env` is gitignored — keep it that way.
#
# Most of this homework is deliberately doable with ZERO API keys: the public
# servers we recommend (filesystem, git, fetch, memory) need none, and your own
# server in `mcp-server/` reads a local JSON file.
#
# This file exists so that IF you connect a server that needs a token
# (Task E bonus path 3), you reference it from the MCP config as
# ${GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN} rather than pasting the literal value.
#
# GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN=
